CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The rrssuu driver currently does not support 802.11n transmit aggregation,
     either A-MSDU or A-MPDU.

     The rrssuu driver does not capture management frames in non-monitor modes;
     without this limitation some firmware functions (e.g., 'join bss') will
     not work properly.

